This is a live Micron page, laid out by the same code the handheld runs. Only
the display backend differs: pixels go to this window instead of the panel's
SPI bus.

>>What to try

 Scroll with the arrow keys. `!Tab`! cycles the links on screen; `!Enter`!
 follows the focused one. `!Backspace`! goes back.

